Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This fog
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems thicker than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to return to the God Slaying Chariot in my bag of holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be more dangerous for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:38.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw in the Ancient God's memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the Moongazer Serpent has 3 forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first is the dormant form
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,with no offensive power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is when the tentacles are withdrawn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Moongazer Serpent will change into various shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the most dangerous assault form.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the tentacles will be extended
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and attack all living beings within its sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That tentacle just now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is quite similar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to this third form.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,1000 zhang long...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.99,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 zhang = 3m
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Moongazer Serpent hasn't fully awakened yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's still transitioning to the third form.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that within these 100 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,someone has come here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw in the memory inheritance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:29.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,what the sensitive spot of a Moongazer Serpent is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,To anesthetize this enormous Moongazer Serpent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must use the Celestial Ascension Fruits at the base of the tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The effect of the Celestial Ascension Fruits probably won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refine !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first Celestial Ascension Fruits are set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to do the same everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(131,540)}3 hours later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I placed Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,on about 80% of the Moongazer Serpent's tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I extract the bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll trigger all of the restrictions at once
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,to anesthetize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before extracting the bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to confirm one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial spiritual energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone really did come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Moongazer Serpent awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pain caused by this injury
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,is enough to enrage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The person who broke this bone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,obviously didn't recognize the Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they would never have dared to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greed !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,They really did come after me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just don't know if those old monsters came together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,or if Greed is all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've already lost the Seven Stars Sword Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I can't leave this mountain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Moongazer Serpent is already in its third form...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he just stabbed his mountain artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inside the Moongazer Serpent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is an extremely poisonous item
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Moonflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only the blood of an Ancient God can neutralize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If anything endangers the Moonflower,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will enrage the Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Moongazer Serpent dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Moonflower will cause its corpse to self-destruct,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,wiping out all living beings
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,except Ancient Gods in the surrounding star system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that he mistook the Moonflower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,for some kind of treasure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Greed laid his hands on the Moonflower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he wasn't killed by the Moongazer Serpent,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,then he was swallowed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever the Moongazer Serpent swallows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,all ends up in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(176,393)}a few days later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpent has its own circulation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excretions don't get expelled
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are instead absorbed again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make more nutrients
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't this just a cesspool ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there a fellow cultivator outside ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really is him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can help this old man to leave this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:56.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,offer you all the artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I have collected in my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greed has been imprisoned here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,but no one has come to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems like he came all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,With no lingering concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can safely start extracting the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This gash left by Greed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,will actually come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Extracting the Moongazer Serpent's bone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,ranks in the top 3 most dangerous things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have ever done in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivation path is a journey against fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Opportunities come and go in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the Moongazer Serpent fully awakens,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,there will not be another chance to extract the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now or never !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Underworld !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Power of the Underworld !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the bottom of the Tide Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I sensed the rift between the two star systems
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and understood this spell by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, while the Moongazer Serpent is drugged,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will use that suction force
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to extract the Moongazer Serpent's bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Extract the bone !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This bone is too big,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It won't fit into a bag of holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must quickly leave before the Moongazer Serpent
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:39.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rise !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpent is about to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Guard !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:40.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1697,459)}Restriction Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have followed me for most of my 900 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,but today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must use you to escape danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:42.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,we...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're falling !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the entire continent that's rising...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpent is raising its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick, go !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can delay it for just a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can escape through these clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Seven Stars Sword Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seven swords, back in formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,heed my command !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You... (Ancient God's language)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,dare ! (Ancient God's language)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancient God's language !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just a single word
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,can shatter space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the shattering spell that only 8-stars Ancient Gods can use !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si's memories didn't show me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,that Moongazer Serpents could speak the Ancient God's language !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Withdraw ! (Ancient God's language)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens have not forsaken me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm finally free !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,grind your bones to dust !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since it has come to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you half
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Moongazer Serpent's bone !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He threw down a mountain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin, you little thief !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you've come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can be the decoy to attract the Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:13:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I have to burn my lifespan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will never go back to that godforsaken place !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,this cauldron anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're trying to kill me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not a chance !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Mountains and Rivers Painting...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it's a fake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,its power is truly astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moongazer's Wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Tu Si's memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the law of the heavens has a spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,then the Ancient Gods have Moongazers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer's Wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,is like the finger of an Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my current strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no way to withstand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could there be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,a trace of Dao on this fingerprint ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:35.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1687,448)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Emperor Crown
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,To activate this Celestial Emperor Crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:38.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I killed 9999 mortal emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and fused their souls inside it !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe it won't stop this beast's finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life Seals,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second Celestial Guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ling Tianhou's sword energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad, this is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't win this fight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,nor can we run away !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only have one last way
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to get out of this situation !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I abandon the burden of my physical body,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can increase my speed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my Origin Soul form !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(139,465)}1 month later
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this thing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have also exhausted my origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the Moongazer Serpent's stamina is endless...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,In front of me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Southern Domain of Allheaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpent
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,has stopped !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that it's hesitating to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Northern Domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Moongazer Serpent is astonishingly powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet it's afraid to enter into this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could there be something even more terrifying than it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.48,0:20:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Southern Domain of Allheaven ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:03.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't overthink it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all my preparations,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never expected this trip to be such a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right now, I need to find a safe place to go into seclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and form a new physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll refine this Moongazer Serpent's bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The completion of the Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,is right before me.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:30.02,0:23:03.90,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}In the memories of Ancient God Tu Si, there was one line he used to describe the Moongazer Serpents.\N“If the law of the heavens has a spirit, then the Ancient Gods have Moongazers!”\NThe spirit can be considered a soul. In short, the first half of the sentence states that the heavens are alive. They have their own existence or a sense of spirit that normal creatures can’t detect.\NThe second half is referring to the Moongazer Serpent. Even Ancient God Tu Si didn’t know how the Moongazer Serpents came to be. They seemed to have already existed for a very long time. It was like the heavens and their spirit, both were elusive things that no one could explain.\N\NYou might wonder how Wang Lin was able to use his Life Seals after he had extracted them previously. He had stored his Life Seals inside his Celestial Guard for it to use them. They just can't regenerate anymore.\N\NWang Lin almost lost his wits. This finger was too fast, and it was quickly closing in. In the midst of this crisis, Wang Lin’s eyes became cold and he placed his hand on the celestial guard. He extracted the slaughter energy from the celestial guard. In an instant, almost one million strands of slaughter energy appeared. They transformed into life seals to block the ancient god finger!\NThe life seals all collapsed as if they were fragile pieces of paper. It didn’t matter how much slaughter energy was used, all of it was powerless before the ancient god finger.
