Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.38,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:03.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:09.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:07.82,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:11.02,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
