Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:16.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:17.30,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:16.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:22.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:22.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:29.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:29.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:35.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:35.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:42.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:42.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:46.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:50.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:50.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:56.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:56.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:22:00.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:22:00.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:03.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:09.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:09.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:15.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:15.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
